{
  "bookId": "hero-213003",
  "id": "bond-27508",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27508001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "好多玫瑰……这是你给我的惊喜吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27508002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "很美呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27508003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你怎么了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27508004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "没有，只是变成实验体之后，第一次有人送给妾身礼物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27508005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "突然觉得，这里的一切好不真实。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27508006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "一直以来，你都把自己隐藏在锋利坚硬的躯壳里。或许之后，你可以更多信任我一点~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27508007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "……主人为什么对我这么好？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27508008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "是对妾身的机甲感兴趣？还是对别的什么地方感兴趣，嗯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27508009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我没有那个意思！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27508010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "是吗，那真遗憾呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27508011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "我还想说，如果主人真感兴趣的话，那妾身也不是不可以……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27508012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "真的吗?",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27508013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "是真的~还是假的呢？主人不妨大胆一点试试看？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
